Decision
UPHELD
OVERTURNED
UNDETERMINED
Score band
0–49
50–69
70–84
85–100
Normalized failure codes

Such as:

LEGIBILITY
COMPOSITION
BRIEF_MISMATCH
STYLE_DRIFT
FACTUAL_SUPPORT
SOURCE_COVERAGE
SCHEDULE_CONFLICT
BUDGET_INCONSISTENCY
PACK_INCOMPLETE

That produces much better consensus.

